{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546640/extras/corastral_title.png?t=1744035139\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face countless perils in this challenging fast-paced runner where timing and reflexes are everything. Dodge obstacles or slash them with your sword. Perform aerial acrobatics to overcome more challenging sections. Reach your goal and discover the truth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546640/extras/ca1.gif?t=1744035139\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control Polaris, a powerful and agile warrior that must reach the Core of his world as soon as possible, where he will face a terrible menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546640/extras/ca2.gif?t=1744035139\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid getting hit, collect objects and complete quests to advance.\u00a0Reach your goal and discover the truth!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 challenging handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smooth responsive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About 2 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original music for each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hidden truth...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546640?t=1744035139","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546640?t=1744035139","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546640/d399cac73f5d1a915eff76732fe802a44fc9a363/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744035139","capsule_imagev5":"http